# UI — Apple, not Microsoft

Few icons. Post + react are enough. Extra actions = long-press, full-width sheet (not a tiny menu). Layouts = mockup 260922; density = Wire screenshots.

- A1: avatar → own profile; `+` → A2 full sheet; search = **existing chats only**.
- Bottom nav: Chats / Profiles / Ads (decided). Do not add a fourth tab.
- Unread rows first, then by last activity. Badge on the row.
- One Post row: avatar, name, date+time, body, reactions. Comments = dim snippet.
- Fields and G1/D1 filters come from schema types. The camera label is **"Taken in app"** (never "Verified" or "Real") = in-app camera + date only.
- Admin actions render only if the role is true — no disabled clutter.
- Mount composer and long-press sheet on demand. Filters apply on "Show", not live, and are remembered on the account.
- Back arrow = go back to the previous screen, not a fixed screen.
- No second design system; CSS transitions only, no animation library.
